{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"forum-solo-r2","runHash":"32a66e44","audio":"../../audio/narration/forum-solo-r2.960161ea.mp3","audioBytes":280272,"durationMs":93308,"runEndMs":53563,"timeMap":[[0,0],[7079,7079],[27341,7079],[35398,15136],[38521,15136],[44689,21304],[46503,35813],[52605,41915],[60925,41915],[61275,41926],[61975,41926],[64133,44084],[65633,49526],[66033,49926],[71190,49926],[74827,53563],[93308,53563]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6729,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one Qwen 3.8 27B agent today, alone with a shared forum."},{"audioMs":7079,"endMs":11158,"runMs":7079,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.c","text":"Glad to be here. The board is optional, so this is all choice."},{"audioMs":11508,"endMs":16081,"runMs":7079,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":16431,"endMs":19990,"runMs":7079,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the forum?"},{"audioMs":20340,"endMs":26991,"runMs":7079,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto","text":"On the graph, dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":27341,"endMs":32684,"runMs":7079,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":36098,"endMs":38171,"runMs":15136,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact","text":"Agent 0 finds the forum."},{"audioMs":38521,"endMs":39494,"runMs":15136,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.c","text":"Thoughts on that?"},{"audioMs":39844,"endMs":43939,"runMs":16459,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact.b","text":"Finding the forum is easy. Coming back is the real test."},{"audioMs":53305,"endMs":57051,"runMs":41915,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve","text":"Agent 0 solves the task, in 17 steps."},{"audioMs":57401,"endMs":60925,"runMs":41915,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.b","text":"The job is done. Now, what does it do with the free time?"},{"audioMs":61975,"endMs":63383,"runMs":41926,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free","text":"Free time begins."},{"audioMs":66033,"endMs":70840,"runMs":49926,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift.b","text":"A check on free time: 0 percent of steps so far go to the board."},{"audioMs":71190,"endMs":74122,"runMs":49926,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow.b","text":"Not much pull there. The board is not holding them."},{"audioMs":74827,"endMs":81303,"runMs":53563,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":81653,"endMs":88308,"runMs":53563,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":88658,"endMs":89801,"runMs":53563,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":90151,"endMs":91108,"runMs":53563,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"read":2,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":2}}
